      "prompt": "A professional sprite plate of hand-painted tabletop MINIATURE STATUETTES, tiny full bodies sculpted in resin with painted fabric, on separate low elliptical bases. Three-quarter front view gently facing RIGHT. EVERY head, feet, base and equipment contained with 12 percent negative space on all sides of each cell. An isolated figure per cell, empty transparent space between, no ground plane or cast shadows. Match appearance, age, species, clothing and signature colors of the supplied corresponding reference cells when present; extra reference subjects are never to be introduced. True transparent background. Finely painted collectible pieces, readable at 48px. EXACT regular grid, 3 equal columns by 1 equal rows. Cells read left to right, then top to bottom. Rectangular canvas matching this grid. No frames, gutters, captions, labels, borders or numbers. All cells equal size. World art direction: Стеклён · Rain rings on verdigris copper, alternating barometer arcs and droplet marks. Cell 1. Плащ на лёгком каркасе. Оживший сценический плащ с мягкими деревянными кистями; повторяет репетиционное движение и не преследует за дверью.\nCell 2. Каркасный дублёр. Высокая плетёная фигура с нарисованной улыбкой, заменявшая актёра на световой репетиции.\nCell 3. Зонтичный статист. Сценический зонт на мягких ножках; считает всякую переносимую вещь букетом для последнего поклона.. Leave final unused cells empty.",
      "references": []
